@api = http://localhost:5000

### Kiem tra API -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### Danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Nop bai -> 201; request co ten de doc ID tu response
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignmentId": 1, "studentCode": "DTC245200349", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/DTC245200349/EduSubmit" }

### Thieu ma sinh vien -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignmentId": 1, "studentCode": "", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/repo" }

### AssignmentId khong hop le -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignmentId": 0, "studentCode": "DTC245200349", "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/repo" }

### Thieu repositoryUrl -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assignmentId": 1, "studentCode": "DTC245200349" }

### Doc lai luot nop -> 200; gui createSubmission truoc
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Ma khong ton tai -> 404
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
